{
  "bookId": "hero-212102",
  "id": "bond-28551",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28551001",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "今天的直播配信也顺利结束了，那么一起来聊聊「幕后花絮」吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551002",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "说起来，为什么会想到举行一场「手办世界」的直播企划呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551003",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "当然是因为大家的热情了！绊爱也是，想要和大家一起愉快玩耍的意愿真是非常强烈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551004",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "做这场直播以前我从来不会想到，在人类注意不到的角落居然生活着这样一群小小、小小的可爱手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551005",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "真是奇妙的世界呀……觉得有这样一趟冒险真好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551006",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "这么说来……直播配信时还发生过一件让人很吃惊的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551007",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "因为我是在直播中才知道，原来还有「手办是不可以在人类面前动起来」这样的规则存在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551008",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "……那一瞬间AI宕机了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551009",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "但是嘛，聪明可爱的我还是让身为手办的大家作为虚拟艺人顺利出道了，哼哼，我很厉害吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28551010",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "咦？想知道经过吗，哈哈，那快一点来关注爱酱「手办世界直播企划」的视频吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
